     1304     DEFINE INPUT PARAMETER p-issuer-hdl AS HANDLE    NO-UNDO.
     1305     DEFINE INPUT PARAMETER p-state      AS CHARACTER NO-UNDO.
     1306     CASE p-state:
     1307     END CASE.
     1308   END PROCEDURE.
